## Build before push / after TSX changes

```bash
cd industry-verticals/sitecoresilver
npm run sitecore-tools:generate-map
npm run sitecore-tools:build
npm run build
```

---

## Per-component loop

```text
Screenshots (sitecoresilver.com) → Cursor (sitecoresilver rules)
→ TSX in industry-verticals/sitecoresilver/src/components/sitecoresilver/
→ YAML in authoring/items/sitecoresilver/ (rendering + datasource + placeholders)
→ If site chrome: partial design + update DefaultPage PartialDesigns
→ If page content: page __Renderings on headless-main only
→ validate --fix → push -n production
→ CM: Available Renderings + headless variants (if multi-export)
→ publish → npm run dev
```

---

## Headless variants (image left / right promo)

When TSX exports `Default`, `ImageLeft`, `ImageRight`:

1. Layout / Renderings → copy **Component Name** from Json Rendering.
2. Site → Presentation → **Headless Variants** → insert variant → paste name.
3. Add variant definitions matching export names.
4. Authors pick layout in Pages.

---

## Product listing (custom — not Sitecore Search)

- Datasource = **products folder** under site `Data/`.
- List child product items; **filters** from **product fields**.
- Product detail: **mobile layout differs** from desktop (reorder composition / direction-of-use blocks).

---

## After push (CM)

| # | Action |
|---|--------|
| 1 | Publish templates, renderings, datasources, **presentation** (partial + page designs) |
| 2 | Confirm **DefaultPage** maps to Headless Page template (`Page Designs.yml`) |
| 3 | Assign **DefaultPage** to pages (or rely on template default) |
| 4 | **Partial design header:** `SitecoreSilverHeader` on `headless-header`, ds `Default Header` |
| 5 | **Partial design footer:** `SitecoreSilverFooter` on `headless-footer`, ds `Default Footer` |
| 6 | Nested chrome: **Navigation** (`SitecoreSilverNavigation` / TS **`SitecoreSilver`**) + **LinkList** on header/footer placeholders — **required** (header has no nav fallback) |
| 7 | Page **Home:** hero + **SitecoreSilverCategoryGrid** on **`headless-main`** (12 TS cards; optional section title DS); publish |
| 8 | **Available Renderings/SitecoreSilver.yml** + **Headless Variants** for LinkList / Navigation |
| 9 | **Promo hero:** CTA only with **`link-button`**; title links when `PromoLink` set |

